# UX7-04: privacy policy required for PII collection (CO, EU, CA, VA).
section.block
  .container
    header
      h2 Privacy Policy
      span.line
    .row
      .col-sm-8
        p Last updated: #{Date.current.strftime('%B %d, %Y')}

        h3 What we collect
        p When you submit our contact form, we collect: your name, email address, phone number (optional), and any text you include in the comment field.

        h3 Why we collect it
        p To respond to your inquiry about our services. We do not sell, rent, or share your information with third parties for marketing purposes.

        h3 How long we keep it
        p 90 days after our last correspondence, then permanently deleted from our email and CRM systems.

        h3 Third parties
        p We use Google Analytics 4 (with IP anonymization) to understand site traffic. We use a transactional email provider to deliver your message to our team. Both are contractually bound to use data only on our behalf.

        h3 Your rights
        p Colorado residents (CPA), California residents (CCPA), and EU residents (GDPR) have the right to access, correct, or delete their personal information. Email info@vivim.net to exercise these rights.

        h3 Contact
        p Questions? Email #{link_to 'info@vivim.net', 'mailto:info@vivim.net'} or call 720.504.0111.
